& [Observed]
  + the first independent custody replay refused the generated manifest at the strict artifact-order gate
  + the builder used PowerShell Sort-Object while the verifier required ordinal path order
  + source sizes and hashes were not credited because ordering is part of the deterministic manifest contract

& [Cause]
  + culture-aware host sorting is not equivalent to ordinal cross-host ordering for the selected path set

& [Correction]
  + both builder and verifier now form unique path sets with StringComparer.Ordinal
  + artifact inventory and source-status fingerprints are rebuilt from the ordinal sequence

& [Boundary]
  + no live Eclipse source file was edited and no generated payload was selected
  + rerun the builder and independent verifier before claiming semantic custody
